      "outputTokens": 0,
      "costUsd": 0,
      "pronunciationText": "Your turn. A lawnmower measures ninety decibels, and a conversation measures sixty. Using L equals ten log base ten of I over I nought, how many times more intense is the lawnmower's sound? Pause here to answer."
